{"id":"n83610-4-7","stage":4,"title":"푹푹 · 热烘烘","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83610-4-7-1","ko":"날이 습한데 덥기까지 하네요.","zh":"天气潮湿，还这么热，真难受。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"날이","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날：天气；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62254","senseId":"3","lemma":"날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"습한데","meaning":"潮湿","explanation":"습하다：潮湿；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"습하다","audio":"/audio/f9c6b95f334f5796df04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83465","senseId":"1","lemma":"습하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"덥기까지","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하네요.","meaning":"表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。","explanation":"하다：表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62899","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"818c8a303c20bac0","term":"날","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3","entryId":"62254","definition":"每一天的雨、云、风、气温等的状态。","pronunciation":["날"]},{"id":"f9c6b95f334f5796","term":"습하다","zh":"潮湿","audio":"/audio/f9c6b95f334f5796df04.mp3","entryId":"83465","definition":"不干燥，水汽重，湿润。","pronunciation":["스파다"]},{"id":"038a0682ef015c0a","term":"덥다","zh":"热，暑","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3","entryId":"44484","definition":"体感气温高。","pronunciation":["덥ː따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62899","definition":"表示首先肯定或强调前句所指的状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2470ec364d303dbb0ece.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83610-4-7-2","ko":"그러게요. 아주 푹푹 찌네요.","zh":"是啊，闷得要命呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러게요.","meaning":"就是嘛，可不嘛","explanation":"그러게：就是嘛，可不嘛；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"그러게","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36269","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"푹푹","meaning":"热烘烘","explanation":"푹푹：热烘烘","readings":[{"term":"푹푹","audio":"/audio/d390cde3ffecf3838762.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83610","senseId":"4","lemma":"푹푹","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찌네요.","meaning":"闷热","explanation":"찌다：闷热；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"찌다","audio":"/audio/22c11459d6526bb8d7a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37216","senseId":"2","lemma":"찌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"87d7b69edce28452","term":"그러게","zh":"就是嘛，可不嘛","audio":"/audio/87d7b69edce28452d447.mp3","entryId":"36269","definition":"用于赞成或同意对方所说的话。","pronunciation":["그러게"]},{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"d390cde3ffecf383","term":"푹푹","zh":"热烘烘","audio":"/audio/d390cde3ffecf3838762.mp3","entryId":"83610","definition":"天气闷热的样子。","pronunciation":["푹푹"]},{"id":"22c11459d6526bb8","term":"찌다","zh":"闷热","audio":"/audio/22c11459d6526bb8d7a9.mp3","entryId":"37216","definition":"如热气升腾般又湿又热。","pronunciation":["찌다"]}],"audio":"/audio/396280636240f7ae5b90.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.73,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=83610","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"고급","day":133,"sequ